The work is provided **“as is”**, without warranty of any kind. The dock can start programs and write configuration or registry entries; use it at your own risk.

Contributors agree to license their contributions under these terms. AI tools are credited as development assistants only and are not copyright holders.

For commercial licensing, contact the author via GitHub.
